hmQ:he How to delete or rename a saved game?
hkA:hi When your are in the save game menu, you can select a slot and press
   CTRL-Backspace to clear it. If you wan't to rename a game, just modify
   its name like if your were overwriting it, but use CTRL-Return instead
   of Return at the end.

hmQ:he How does it run ?
hkA:hi It does not run.

hmQ:he Can I see the map of each standard level?
hkA:hi Yep! There is a way... try to find it! Think of the [P] facility
