hmQ:he I've never had a (girl/boy)friend...is it serious, doctor ?
hkA:hi You must be a damn good coder !!!

hmQ:he I am shocked by the game mode in which you have to kill people by
he   dirving on them (Tien am men rulez ?!?). Where is the morality in this 
he   game ?
hkA:hi Heroes is not meant to be taken at the first level of interpretation
   we of course DO NOT encourage people to kill each other. We are pacifists
   but this does not mean we cannot have fun with games dealing with killing,
   because we can make a clear difference between this game and reality. We
   think very strongly that most people make this difference and that the
   violence shown in this game will not lead to real life violence. We think
   that TV, Cinema and of course video games have no real influence on 
   people's behaviour, and if you feel influenced by this game, then stop
   playing it ! This game is a pure product of fiction and should be taken
   at the 46th level of interpretation. In any case, Nor Realtech, nor 
   Olympus, nor anyone involved in the hkHEROEShi project can be held as 
   responsible if something bad happens because of this game. We count on
   you to act as adults and not as stupid lobotomized people. Have fun !

hmQ:he I've heard there are new recruiting methods using computers used
he   by some firms to see if a given person must be hired or not, and 
he   that people like Bill Gates would not pass that test. Is this true ?
hkA:hi Yes, and the last remark shows us that these programs work quite well !

